#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Filename              :       CustAcctInquiry_SendResponse.scr
# Author                :       Venkatesh T R
# Description           :       This script sets the values in Response XML
# Input                 :       None
# Output                :       None
# Called Script         :       None
# Calling Script        :       CustAcctInquiry_main.scr
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----           -----           --------          ----------------        ---------
